Piecewise: use cases:
\begin{cases} x^2 & x >= 0 \\ -x^2 & x < 0 \end{cases}

Fractions: \frac{a}{b}
Integrals: \int_0^infinity
Summations: \sum_i=1^n
Limits: \lim x to 0

RULES:
- NEVER write matrices as [ a b ] or | a b | pipes
- NEVER wrap math in triple-backtick fences
- NEVER mix $$ with code fences
